  "ruleText": "Ed 1017.15 Personally Identifiable Information (PII). Personally identifiable information (PII) and other personal information and data shall be collected and shared pursuant to the provisions of Ed 1003.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1, #2, and #3 at chapter heading for Ed 1000) #13231, eff 7-13-21",
